From 566a5293e85c8463a4c60dfeacf8ccf5cd9c9e05 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Gonzalez Martin <davidgmbb@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:07:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Experiment with native rows for direct integer return calls

Private #2850 qualification prototype. Check the bound prototype, integer
literal, paid native call descriptor and per-object declarations before
retaining a call. The BUSTER_CALL_* switches support paired controls
and side-fact mutations for the evidence run.

Signed-off-by: David Gonzalez Martin <davidgmbb@gmail.com>
---
